  {
   "xml_index": 17,
   "xml_name": "L09_017_Counting Letters",
   "display_name": "Counting Letters",
   "questiontext_html": "<p>The most common use of a dictionary is <b>counting</b>: each key is a thing, and its value is how many times we have seen it. For each new thing, add 1 to its count, starting from 0 if it is new:</p>\n<pre>counts[x] = counts.get(x, 0) + 1</pre>\n<table style=\"border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:2px 1px;margin:6px 0 4px\"><tr><td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace\">counts =</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:4px 8px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace;font-size:13px;background:#cfdcec;color:#1f3a63;border-radius:2px 2px 0 0\">&#x27;b&#x27;</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:4px 8px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace;font-size:13px;background:#cfdcec;color:#1f3a63;border-radius:2px 2px 0 0\">&#x27;a&#x27;</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:4px 8px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace;font-size:13px;background:#cfdcec;color:#1f3a63;border-radius:2px 2px 0 0\">&#x27;n&#x27;</td><td style=\"padding-left:8px;font-size:12px;color:#8a939c\">key<br><br>value</td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:5px 8px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;background:rgb(31,95,153);color:#fff;border-radius:0 0 2px 2px\">1</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:5px 8px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;background:rgb(52,129,188);color:#fff;border-radius:0 0 2px 2px\">3</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:5px 8px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;background:rgb(74,163,223);color:#fff;border-radius:0 0 2px 2px\">2</td></tr></table><div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a939c;margin:0 0 10px\">after counting the letters of &#x27;banana&#x27;</div>\n<p><b>Indentation reminder:</b> the body of an <code>if</code>, loop, function or class must be indented (press Tab or type 4 spaces). Only the spaces at the start of a line matter.</p>\n<p><b>Your task:</b> write the function <code>letter_counts(word)</co