   "xml_name": "L09_018_Word Count",
   "display_name": "Word Count",
   "questiontext_html": "<p>The same pattern counts words: split the text into words, then count them.</p>\n<p><b>Your task:</b> write the function <code>word_count(text)</code>, which returns a dictionary from each word in <code>text</code> (words are separated by spaces, and are already lowercase) to how many times it appears, with the keys in the order the words first appear.</p>\n<p>For example, <code>word_count(\"to be or not to be\")</code> returns <code>{'to': 2, 'be': 2, 'or': 1, 'not': 1}</code>.</p>",
