  {
   "xml_index": 30,
   "xml_name": "L09_030_Difference",
   "display_name": "Difference",
   "questiontext_html": "<p>The <b>difference</b> <code>a - b</code> (or <code>a.difference(b)</code>) contains the items of <code>a</code> that are <b>not</b> in <code>b</code>. Unlike union and intersection, the order matters: <code>a - b</code> and <code>b - a</code> are different.</p>\n<div style=\"position:relative;width:310px;height:175px;margin:6px 0 4px\"><div style=\"position:absolute;left:10px;top:18px;width:170px;height:150px;border-radius:50%;border:2px solid #2b4c7e;background:rgba(43,76,126,.07)\"></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:120px;top:18px;width:170px;height:150px;border-radius:50%;border:2px solid #2a8c8c;background:rgba(42,140,140,.07)\"></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:60px;top:0;font-weight:600;color:#2b4c7e\">a</div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:230px;top:0;font-weight:600;color:#2a8c8c\">b</div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:28px;top:55px;width:66px;text-align:center\"><div style=\"background:#2b4c7e;color:#fff;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 5px;margin:2px 0;font-family:monospace;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;display:inline-block\">1</div><br><div style=\"background:#2b4c7e;color:#fff;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 5px;margin:2px 0;font-family:monospace;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;display:inline-block\">2</div><br></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:128px;top:55px;width:66px;text-align:center\"><div style=\"color:#8a939c;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 5px;margin:2px 0;font-family:monospace;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;display:inline-block\">3</div><br><div style=\"color:#8a939c;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 5px;margin:2px 0;font-family:monospace;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;display:inline-block\">4</div><br></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:214px;top:55px;width:66px;text-align:center\"><div style=\"color:#8a939c;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 5px;margin:2px 0;font-family:monospace;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;display:inline-block\">5</div><br><div style=\"color:#8a939c;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 5px;margin:2px 0;font-family:monospace;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;display:inline-block\">6</div><br></div></div><div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a939c;margin:0 0 10px\">a - b is {1, 2}</div>\n<div style=\"position:relative;width:310px;height:175px;margin:6px 0 4px\"><div style=\"position:absolute;left:10px;top:18px;width:170px;height:150px;border-radius:50%;border:2px solid #2b4c7e;background:rgba(43,76,126,.07)\"></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:120px;top:18px;width:170px;height:150px;border-radius:50%;border:2px solid #2a8c8c;background:rgba(42,140,140,.07)\"></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:60px;top:0;font-weight:600;color:#2b4c7e\">a</div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:230px;top:0;font-weight:600;color:#2a8c8c\">b</div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:28px;top:55px;width:66px;text-align:center\"><div style=\"color:#8a939c;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 5px;margin:2px 0;font-family:monospace;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;display:inline-block\">1</div><br><div style=\"color:#8a939c;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 5px;margin:2px 0;font-family:monospace;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;display:inline-block\">2</div><br></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:128px;top:55px;width:66px;text-align:center\"><div style=\"color:#8a939c;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 5px;margin:2px 0;font-family:monospace;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;display:inline-block\">3</div><br><div style=\"color:#8a939c;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 5px;margin:2px 0;font-family:monospace;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;display:inline-block\">4</div><br></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:214px;top:55px;width:66px;text-align:center\"><div style=\"background:#2b4c7e;color:#fff;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 5px;margin:2px 0;font-family:monospace;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;display:inline-block\">5</div><br><div style=\"background:#2b4c7e;color:#fff;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 5px;margin:2px 0;font-family:monospace;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;display:inline-block\">6</div><br></div></div><div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a939c;margin:0 0 10px\">b - a is {5, 6}</div>\n<p><b>Your task:</b> write the function <code>still_to_do(tasks, done)</code>, where <code>tasks</code> and <code>done</code> are lists of task names. Return a sorted list of the tasks that are not done yet (<code>done</code> may also contain things that are not in <code>tasks</code>; ignore them).</p>\n<p>For example, <code>still_to_do([\"cook\", \"shop\", \"study\"], [\"shop\", \"sleep\"])</code> returns <code>['cook', 'study']</code>.</p>",
   "answerpreload": "# Define still_to_do(tasks, done): use a difference.\n\n\n\n# ---- Use this space to test your code; comment it out before Check ----\n# print(still_to_do([\"cook\", \"shop\", \"study\"], [\"shop\", \"sleep\"]))\n",
   "mark": 1.0,
   "tests": [
