   "display_name": "Common Words",
   "questiontext_html": "<p>Now choose the right tools yourself: a dictionary to look things up or count, a set to remove duplicates or compare groups, a list to keep order. Test with small examples, including empty inputs.</p>\n<p><b>Your task:</b> write the function <code>common_words(text1, text2)</code>, which returns a sorted list of the different words that appear in both strings (words are separated by spaces and are already lowercase).</p>\n<p>For example, <code>common_words(\"the cat sat\", \"a cat and the dog\")</code> returns <code>['cat', 'the']</code>.</p>",
