   "xml_name": "L09_037_Students In Every Club",
   "display_name": "Students In Every Club",
   "questiontext_html": "<p>Now choose the right tools yourself: a dictionary to look things up or count, a set to remove duplicates or compare groups, a list to keep order. Test with small examples, including empty inputs.</p>\n<p><b>Your task:</b> write the function <code>in_every_club(clubs)</code>, where <code>clubs</code> is a non-empty dictionary from club names to lists of member names. Return a sorted list of the students who are members of <b>every</b> club.</p>\n<p>For example, <code>in_every_club({\"chess\": [\"Asha\", \"Ravi\"], \"music\": [\"Ravi\", \"Asha\", \"Zoya\"], \"art\": [\"Ravi\", \"Asha\"]})</code> returns <code>['Asha', 'Ravi']</code>.</p>",
   "answerpreload": "# Define in_every_club(clubs).\n\n\n\n# ---- Use this space to test your code; comment it out before Check ----\n# print(in_every_club({\"chess\": [\"Asha\", \"Ravi\"], \"music\": [\"Ravi\", \"Asha\", \"Zoya\"]}))\n",
   "mark": 1.0,
   "tests": [
    {
     "testcode": "print(in_every_club({\"chess\": [\"Asha\", \"Ravi\"], \"music\": [\"Ravi\", \"Asha\", \"Zoya\"], \"art\": [\"Ravi\", \"Asha\"]}))",
     "stdin": "",
     "expected": "['Asha', 'Ravi']",
     "extra": "",
     "show": true,
     "example": true,
     "in_precheck": true,
     "in_check": true
    },
    {
     "testcode": "print(in_every_club({\"solo\": [\"X\", \"Y\"]}))",
     "stdin": "",
     "expected": "['X', 'Y']",
     "extra": "",
     "show": true,
     "example": true,
     "in_precheck": false,
     "in_check": true
    },
    {
     "testcode": "print(in_every_club({\"a\": [\"p\"], \"b\": [\"q\"]}))",
     "stdin": "",
     "expected": "[]",
     "extra": "",
     "show": false,
     "example": false,
     "in_precheck": false,
     "in_check": true
    },
    {
     "testcode": "print(in_every_club({\"a\": [\"m\", \"n\"], \"b\": [\"n\", \"m\"], \"c\": [\"n\"]}))",
     "stdin": "",
     "expected": "['n']",
     "extra": "",
     "show": false,
     "example": false,
     "in_precheck": false,
     "in_check": true
